"""Layer-0 MLP down_proj component 2387: a negative "place name" detector.

Almost always about 0. It goes negative on a word that names a place, and the more
prominent the place name, the more negative it is:
- Europe (European, Europe, Europa, Европа, and Chinese 欧洲): about -7, the strongest;
- the EU, the euro and the euro sign (EU, Euro, €): about -3;
- continents and large regions (Asia, Asian, Africa, African, Nordic, Baltic, Pacific,
  Mediterranean, 亚洲, 非洲): about -2;
- countries, cities and other place names (America, Australia, Germany, England, Canada,
  London, Japan, ...): about -1;
