"""Negative pulses for familiar compound names and software expressions.

The strongest cases are Android/Spring package names, branded product
names, repository URLs, and tool commands. We use shared strengths for
these recognizable families, rather than memorizing token identifiers.
Domain endings and repository paths have their own small rules.
