trade, inventory and harvest forms are negative. Chinese 汇/匯/彙 and some
of their UTF-8 pieces give the largest negatives. A few other Chinese
spellings also respond. 'of' borrows 56% of the previous response, with
memory reset at document boundaries. Unrecognised tokens give zero:
this leaves the diffuse, low-amplitude background unexplained.
